### Test Chatbot Integration
POST http://localhost:6000/api/chatbot/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello! Can you introduce yourself?"
}

###

### Test with specific call ID
POST http://localhost:6000/api/chatbot/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What data do you have access to?",
  "callSid": "TEST_CHAT_001"
}

###

### Get Active Chat Sessions
GET http://localhost:6000/api/chatbot/sessions

###

### Clear Chat Session
DELETE http://localhost:6000/api/chatbot/sessions/TEST_CHAT_001

###
